label Greeting
if {Transaction_VisitVar} <= 50:
	Brahim: Just observing the background processes of the town. The ambiance today has a very low-latency vibe.
	Brahim: It's peaceful. Almost like a clean install of reality.
else:
	Brahim: Scanning the environment. The sunlight filtration through your storefront is visually pleasing. 
	Brahim: It's a stable build, Karimlan. I'm glad I migrated my data here.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Smalltalk
if {Transaction_VisitVar} <= 50:
	Brahim: Idle cycle complete. [pause=0.3] Hanging out in front of your store really clears the cache.
	Brahim: Disconnecting for now, Karimlan. Keep the uptime steady.
else:
	Brahim: Ambient diagnostics look solid out here. Zero packet loss in the barangay breeze. [pause=0.3]
	Brahim: I'll log off and head back. See you on the next sync.
[end_timeline]